WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.060
It seems to be some kind of 
"area of affect" magic that alters the mind,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.070
but we won't know the details until....

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.080
<b>Japan</b>

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.080
<b>Russia</b>

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.820
Just dealing with Princess Kaguya
 is bad enough...

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.880
Now we have another powerful Origin Master.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.280
What do we do?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.260
We can't beat them in a head-on fight.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.300
Yeah...

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.810
We have to do it.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:47.690
Yeah...

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.650
Anyone against it?

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.480
No objections.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.910
Impressive, comrades.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:55.860
That's right.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:00.330
We have to win the Hexennacht, no matter what.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.460
To make Comrade Tatiana's wish come true.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:44.010
<b>Episode 7: 
The Allegory of the Honest Man</b>

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.440
I want to get taller.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:58.550
What? Your wish if you win the Hexennacht

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.150
is something so small?

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.450
What about you, Mai?

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:08.520
Um... I want my breasts 
to get a little smaller.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.420
My shoulders ache, and people stare.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.620
Argh!

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.290
What about you, Shizuka-chan?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.840
I just want to win.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.360
Just like my mother once did.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.330
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.880
I'm sorry...

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.980
I'm doing the same thing.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.700
Trying to get rid of 
my nervousness in the bath.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.600
I'm Tatiana from the Russian school.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.450
Nice to meet you.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.780
<i>The Russian school.</i>

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.210
<i>That's who we fight in Round 1 tomorrow.</i>

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.920
I-I'm...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.290
Hazuki Kagimura from the Japanese school.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:00.450
The amazing maedchen who made a contract

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.160
with the Cinderella Origin 
and rewrote the story!

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:06.800
Hey, Hazuki-san, how does that magic work?

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.260
I'm sorry, but...

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:12.510
My Origin, Ivan the Fool,

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:17.480
can stop anybody from using magic 
within a 500-meter radius for three minutes.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.110
Wow!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.820
But there's a problem.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.880
Now it doesn't just stop my enemies' magic,

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.160
it shuts down my allies' magic, too.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.110
What do I do tomorrow?

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:34.010
My magic was the big reason 
we won the qualifiers.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.130
Everybody's upset...

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.990
<i>It feels like she's telling me 
something really important!</i>

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.880
By the way, our leader Maria's magic...

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.510
Wait!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:51.050
I-I don't think it's good to tell 
your opponents that stuff.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.480
What do I do?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:03.410
Maria told me not to tell anyone.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.530
I'm a fool, so I always...

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.670
That's...

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.790
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.420
There's no reason for you to apologize.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.380
Maybe.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.730
And wouldn't it be better not to stop me

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.090
and learn what you can instead?

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.300
Maybe!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.820
Ура́!

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.190
What was that?

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:51.160
It's a Russian phase you can use when 
you're happy or want to cheer up.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.870
I'm friends with you now, so...

00:05:58.380 --> 00:05:59.580
Ура́!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.780
Ура́!

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:02.000
Ура́!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.800
Ура́!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.860
Ура́!

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:10.430
Let's do our best at the match tomorrow!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.140
Yeah, let's.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.690
Did the principal bring these?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.660
I guess it's okay.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.530
Time for a drink.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.990
Welcome back.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.940
That was a good bath, in a lot of ways.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.620
Isn't it about time for you to go home?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:44.120
I said I'd be staying at a friend's house.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.810
So... Um...

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:50.510
M-May I have a room to stay in?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.900
If you don't want to, that's fine.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:55.370
I'll stay in Ariko-san's house or something.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.810
No, that's really rude.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.630
Of course, I'd love to.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:04.540
You can stay in my room, if you like.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.230
Okay.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.470
Why?

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:13.320
Ninety percent of Asians are supposed
 to lack the enzymes to digest milk.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.720
They drank so much...

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.930
A fatal dose, even...

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:24.050
And why... Why aren't they getting sick?

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.780
They get stomachaches and can't move 
for three days and have to abandon the match.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.300
It was a perfect plan!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.420
And what's more...

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:33.430
We even had some stomach medicine ready

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.150
because we thought it wouldn't be fair 
to knock them out for three days.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.560
No, it's not over yet.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.150
Now that we know that the Japanese 
team has monster stomachs,

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.290
we'll just come up with a different plan.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.020
Anyone against it?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:46.940
No objections.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.270
Ура́!

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.990
Okay, I'll explain the next plan.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:55.060
We lock Hazuki Kagimura in the 
basement until the match is over.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.760
This room has a lock on the outside.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:01.910
Nobody ever comes down here,
 and phones can't get reception.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:06.380
Yes, it looks perfect 
for locking someone in, but...

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.340
Is there a problem with this perfect plan?

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.750
Yes. There's one problem.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.340
If we want to lock the Japanese team in here,

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.550
we need to clean it.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.010
Brilliant observation, Comrade Eva!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.490
I see!

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:22.600
It would be terrible if they got asthma!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.980
Don't worry!

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.310
Amazing, Comrade Eva!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.670
Comrades, follow Eva!

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.860
Make this room into a pleasant place to stay!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.320
Ура́!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:41.120
We've turned it into 
a splendidly elegant room.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.460
Now we need to lure the Japanese team here.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.590
I don't think sweet sweets 
would be enough to do it...

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.520
A letter.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.470
A letter?

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:55.420
Yes.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:59.430
We'll just write a love letter 
and tell them to meet us here.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.640
I see!

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.830
<i>Dear Hazuki-dono.</i>

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:10.790
<i>I don't think that we can defeat 
you and the Japanese team.</i>

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.170
<i>So while I realize that this is cheating,</i>

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:17.010
<i>we're planning to lock you in the basement.</i>

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.730
<i>Please come immediately.</i>

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.630
Is that a love letter?

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:23.750
There's no way she'll come for that.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:28.840
I've never written a l-love letter!

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.210
Do you have a problem with that?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.420
Let me handle it.

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.120
<i>Dear Hazuki-san.</i>

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:38.860
<i>I'm sorry for writing this sudden letter.</i>

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.750
<i>I fell in love with your beauty</i>

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.850
<i>the first time I saw you at the Hexennacht.</i>

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:51.410
<i>I think of you all day, 
and my heart feels like it's going to burst.</i>

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:56.590
<i>May I have a moment to tell you how I feel?</i>

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.400
Who's this from?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.480
I'm waiting in the storeroom.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.450
How can you lie so easily?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:09.330
Comrades, we're so lucky 
to have such a teammate!

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.540
Ура́!

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.630
Um...

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.730
The door!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:21.960
Huh?

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.600
It worked.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.750
What an awful thing to do to a young girl.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.480
Oh, God! Please at least 
limit your punishment to me...

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.620
What are you saying, Eva?

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.370
This was my idea.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.930
I shall take full responsibility!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.310
Oh, yeah.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.700
I closed the door, and it locked.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.640
Nobody was here.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:48.450
Yeah.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.580
Shizuka-chan, can you come down? 
It's Floor B3.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.750
I-Impossible!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:57.930
It's three stories underground! 
How can you use your phone?

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.750
Free Wi-Fi...

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.350
I should've noticed when 
we were able to send that text...

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:13.610
I can't! You're supposed 
to do your own homework!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.680
My mom's sick, actually.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.760
So is my grandma.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.910
I have to stay up 
all night taking care of her.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.740
That's awful.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:28.500
Okay, I'll do it for you!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.880
Comrade Tatiana's endless 
supply of honest and naivety

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.260
has been abused by wicked people.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.720
How naïve can you be?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.380
But they said a family member was sick...

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.180
The same thing happened a week ago.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:51.690
I believe it was their dad, their little brother,
 and their pet who were sick.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.540
Is that right?

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:54.700
That means...

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.430
Their mom and grandma and 
their dad and their little brother

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.700
and their pet dog are all sick?

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:01.900
Oh, no!

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.400
It's fine, Comrade Eva.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.700
It won't take long if we help.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.000
That's right.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.120
Now, let's go faster!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.780
Ура́!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.400
But we got by, anyway.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.840
But that day...

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.830
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.640
This happened because I was so stupid.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:36.190
If only I were smarter...

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.490
Comrade Nadia...

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:51.500
I'm sorry to bring you with me on my rounds.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.520
Are you scared?

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.670
A lot of maedchen are scared 
to come into the library at night.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:01.080
I like the library.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.470
And I'm with you...

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:09.620
Wait here.

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.340
It's all done.

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:28.450
Hazuki-san?

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.240
Shizuka-chan?

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.370
Hey!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.830
Oh, no!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.550
Where am I?

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.390
We're locked in...

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.470
The power of the Origin, The Mitten.

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:57.060
All Suction.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.430
That's right.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:03.280
With the power of your All Suction, 
you can trap all of their players.

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.230
There's one problem.

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:06.860
They'll see the mitten.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.240
They'll know we did it.

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:12.290
That could mean trouble.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.480
Even if we win tomorrow,

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:17.550
if their players tell the Committee, 
they'll know we cheated,

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.250
and we'll be disqualified.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.210
But there's one solution.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.690
Say I did it all on my own.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.230
Nobody knew anything.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.010
Nobody heard anything.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.690
If we do that, everyone will be happy.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:33.970
No!

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:42.760
You all taught me how to speak 
when I came from deep in the mountains.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.710
I can pay you back now.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.870
I'll be expelled.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.640
But my heart will always be with you all.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.370
Let us out!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.490
Let us out!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.170
Let us out!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.000
It's not budging!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.650
And my phone won't connect.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:05.800
What do we do?

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.600
Stand back,

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.590
Hazuki-san!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.270
I'll blow it away with the moon ship!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.730
Calm down, Shizuka-chan!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.470
If you use that here, won't we die?

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:24.230
Won't we die?

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:26.610
Where's Comrade Nadia?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.150
Sh-She said she's not hungry.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.320
She went for a walk.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.740
Tell me.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.570
We're comrades, right?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.760
The match is tomorrow!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.930
It's too early to use 
your Buchhülle, isn't it?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.640
Y-You're...

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:03.760
Yumilia Qazan. With the Coalition.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.230
Shuten-doji!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.760
Hazuki and Shizuka are inside that box, huh?

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.700
Those girls are a pain to take care of, huh?

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:25.990
Wh-Why are you getting in our way?

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.470
It's because of the Japanese school 
that your wish won't come true!

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:30.500
Am I wrong?

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.670
You're right.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.050
We've lost our chance to receive
 the wish-granting magic.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:35.880
But...

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:42.060
They made me realize that 
there's something more important!

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.660
I didn't make it to the main match,

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.880
but I, Yumelia Qazan, 
will not lose in a fair fight!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:51.900
Don't mess with me!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.970
So if you get near that mitten, 
it absorbs you, huh?

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.370
Then...

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.710
I'll do this from a distance!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.430
Not happening!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.220
You've got your match tomorrow.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.660
I won't hurt you.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.480
Release Hazuki and Shizuka.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:29.640
What?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.670
N-Now the match tomorrow...

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:42.310
No...

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.080
Already?

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:52.000
N-No...

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:56.050
What happened?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.140
Where am I?

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.030
Shizuka-chan! Shizuka-chan!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.100
Wake up! Something happened!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:10.700
Hazuki-san...

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:11.860
Hey!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.040
I came to help you because I was worried,

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:17.570
and you were being all 
lovey-dovey in the mitten?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.910
L-Lovey-dovey?

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.380
Why did my magic...

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:29.800
C-Comrade Tatiana...

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.920
The sealing magic...

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:38.440
I'm sorry. They did this all for me...

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:41.140
So it's my fault.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.100
I'm so sorry.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.680
Let us explain.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.370
It happened two weeks ago.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:53.260
Someone claiming to be a messenger 
from the Committee visited Comrade Tatiana...

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.600
Submit your Origin.

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.610
You should've received a message.

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.110
The rules say

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.080
that the Origins must be turned over 
for inspection prior to the Hexennacht.

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:07.870
Oh, I see!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:08.810
Here you go.

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:14.040
The book was found shortly thereafter.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.500
I'm sorry... I'm sorry.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.340
This happened because I was so stupid.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:22.830
If I were smarter...

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.060
I'll make that wish come true.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.470
If you win the Hexennacht,

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:39.760
any wish you make can come true.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:42.370
Comrade Tatiana, I promise you,

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:45.460
I won't let you cry like that again!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.150
Everyone...

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.530
It's my fault!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:54.820
I'm sorry!

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:00.550
I promised you I wouldn't 
let you cry anymore, but...

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.010
I'm a fool!

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:04.440
That's terrible, though...

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:05.970
Who would do that?

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:11.110
We don't know who did it, or why.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.690
The Origin was tainted.

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:18.140
That magic, the Joys of Physical Labor,

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:22.490
was originally supposed to silence 
all enemy magic within 500 meters.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:27.150
But now it affects all allies, too.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:32.020
I know it's shameful, but please, 
people of the Japanese school,

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.790
don't tell anyone about this.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.130
Give us a chance to fight 
you in the Hexennacht.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.090
Please!

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.020
What do we do?

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:45.800
Ура́!

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.260
Let's forgive them!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:52.420
I got to sleep next to you, because of that.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:54.240
If anything, I'm grateful.

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.370
Right?

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.120
All right.

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.230
Yay!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:02.500
But we won't show any mercy during the match.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:04.780
Let's all do our best.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.230
Of course.

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:07.360
Thank you!

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.330
Hazuki-san, thank you.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.050
Ура́!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.600
It's finally time...

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:30.060
The Hexennacht is beginning.

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:06.760
It's me, Hazuki.

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:07.890
Maria Rasputin!

00:23:07.890 --> 00:23:08.720
Hey, hey, Pu-chan.

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:09.820
Who are you calling Pu-chan?

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:11.320
I'm Rasputin!

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:12.690
Pu-chan is cuter!

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:14.320
I said I'm not...

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:15.580
C-Cute?

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:18.160
Every girl can be a cute heroine!

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:20.040
I've written a book based 
on my own experiences!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:23.000
And you can have it today at a special price!

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:23.690
I'll take it!

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:24.760
One book. No, three!

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:27.600
No, forget it! Just give me all you've got!

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:29.590
Next time: Pull Out a Big Turnip.

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Episode 8: 

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:32.050
Free shipping, and installment 
plans are available!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:34.390
I'm a girl!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.050
<b>Illustration: Tabun</b>
